# Force LF for files that get sourced/executed by bash (WSL/Linux), regardless
# of core.autocrlf on the checking-out machine. A CRLF shebang line breaks
# with "bash\r: No such file or directory", and a CRLF .env sourced by bash
# leaks a stray \r into the last variable on each line.
*.sh text eol=lf
.env.example text eol=lf
